#: e9843ad63b6d499ca4a8e4cc5b47b000
msgid "The KakuteF4 supports up to 4 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 on the above diagram are for the 4 outputs. All 4 outputs support DShot as well as all PWM types. The M5 and M6 outputs are not currently available with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4.rst:98
#: 1019301b90fb482d8b0ef27c5dcd9461
msgid "The PWM is in 2 groups:"
msgstr ""

